'''Patrick''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "PATR1CK"<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/710567556558528512</ref>. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Codes|code]] has since expired.

==Appearance==
Its blade is green with four leaf clovers varying in different shades of green and sizes imprinted all over it. The guard is green, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It was released as a celebration for St. Patrick’s Day on March 17th, 2016, and is currently the only weapon related to it.

